    "私密分析只在本次界面保留，不自动保存任务、来源网址或回答。发送前会说明模型服务；主动保存或导出后，结果会保留在设备上。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Private analysis stays in this session. Tasks, source URLs and answers are not saved automatically. The model service is shown before sending; results you choose to save or export remain on the device."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私密分析只在本次界面保留，不自动保存任务、来源网址或回答。发送前会说明模型服务；主动保存或导出后，结果会保留在设备上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私密分析只在本次介面保留，不自動儲存任務、來源網址或回答。傳送前會說明模型服務；主動儲存或匯出後，結果會保留在裝置上。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Private analysis stays in this session. Tasks, source URLs and answers are not saved automatically. The model service is shown before sending; results you choose to save or export remain on the device."
          }
        },
